Add Node.js 26 to the supported Node.js versions of the Aurora (`aurora_addon`, `aurora_cmfplone`, `aurora_nick`, `aurora_nick_embedded`) and Volto (`frontend_addon`, `project`, `monorepo_addon`, `volto_nick`) templates, in preparation for Node.js 26 becoming LTS. `aurora_cmfplone` and the Volto monorepo project and add-on templates now pass their own list of supported Node.js versions instead of relying on Cookieplone's default. @sneridagh
